 in its subsidiary AOSL Energy Services to Sadhav for Rs 26,000 to form a joint venture in the offshore marine sector.","**REC Limited** — its subsidiary REC Power Development transfers its project-specific SPV, Luhri Power Transmission Limited, to successful bidder Terralight Solar Energy Tinwari for a consideration of Rs 4.13 cr.","**Cyient** — its 50:50 joint venture with HAL, Infotech HAL Limited, is dissolved by the NCLT Bengaluru Bench following completion of its liquidation.","**Global Education** — the NCLT Mumbai Bench sanctions the demerger of unlisted Yola Stays' real estate business into Rishiraj Infravision; Global Education, as a shareholder, will receive 24,00,000 shares in Rishiraj in a 1-for-1 ratio."],"order_wins":["**Data Patterns** — wins a **Rs 585.76 crore order** from Bharat Electronics Limited for procurement of Radar Electronics _(~2.2% of mcap)_.","**Ceigall India** — receives a **Rs 225.00 crore (incl. GST) Letter of Award** from HPSIDC to develop the Bulk Drug Park (Phase I) in Una, Himachal Pradesh over 18 months _(~4.1% of mcap)_.","**Puravankara** — its subsidiary Starworth Infrastructure receives a **Rs 175.00 crore Letter of Intent** from Red Connect for civil and structural works at the Ritz-Carlton project in Chennai over 32 months _(~3.4% of mcap)_.","**Pace Digitek** — its subsidiary Lineage Power wins a **Rs 92.93 crore (incl. GST) order** from Kalpa Power to supply a 100 MWh battery energy storage system (BESS) by December 2026 _(~2.5% of mcap)_.","**S&S Power Switchgear** — its subsidiary Hamilton Research wins an order worth **over Rs 50.00 crore** from Vedanta Aluminium to supply Pot Control Systems _(~14.9% of mcap)_.","**Kay Cee Energy** — wins **two same-day RVPN maintenance orders** totaling **Rs 26.42 crore** for the Jaipur Rural and Hindaun circles _(~28.5% of mcap)_.","**E To E Transportation** — receives a **Rs 26.37 crore Letter of Acceptance** from North Eastern Railway for electronic interlocking and telecom works _(~5.1% of mcap)_.","**Jhaveri Credits & Capital** — receives a **Rs 10.65 crore Letter of Intent** from GEDA for solar rooftop installations on government buildings in Gujarat over 120 days _(~5.5% of mcap)_.","**Bajel Projects** — its associate AnantGrid Projects One (held 26:74 with NIIF) receives a Letter of Intent as the successful bidder for the Lakadia Inter-State Transmission Scheme Part-A in Gujarat, involving construction of ~270 km of 765 KV lines.","**Innovision** — bags an NHAI toll collection and maintenance contract for the Etaura Bujurg and Akhtiyari Kotila plazas in Uttar Pradesh for 1 year, at a gross value of Rs 51.54 cr."],"other_notable":["**Jyoti Ltd** — a 2002 recovery suit for Rs 1.84 cr (plus interest) filed by Navinbhai Cables is dismissed by the Bombay City Civil Court.","**Natco Pharma** — receives a US FDA Form 483 with 4 procedural observations following conclusion of an inspection at its Visakhapatnam formulations facility.","**Zydus Lifesciences** — receives final approval from the US FDA for Ascorbic Acid Injection (500 mg/mL, 50 mL vial) with 180 days of Competitive Generic Therapy exclusivity."]},"unlocks":[{"company":"Mayank Cattle Food Ltd","date":"2026-08-21","days":0,"detail":"BUY BY 21-08-2026 · record date 24-08-2026 · 1:1 bonus","ex_date":"2026-08-24","mcap":132.6,"pct":null,"shares":0,"symbol":"MCFL","type":"BONUS","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/56793020-a4bf-46f6-a010-0f11fee902fe.pdf"},{"company":"Aurum PropTech Ltd","date":"2026-08-21","days":0,"detail":"Conversion listed","instrument_id":"16435","mcap":1782.3,"pct":null,"pct_of":"equity","shares":39775,"src":"BSE+NSE","symbol":"AURUM","type":"CONVERSION","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260820-8/20260820-8.pdf"},{"company":"GACM Technologies Limited","date":"2026-08-21","days":0,"detail":"QIP placement listed · allotted 17-08-2026","instrument_id":"12842","mcap":109.2,"pct":30.98,"pct_of":"equity","shares":4